```python
def valid_thai_id(pid: str) -> bool:
    if len(pid) != 13 or not pid.isdigit():
        return False
    total = sum(int(pid[i]) * (13 - i) for i in range(12))
    return (11 - total % 11) % 10 == int(pid[12])
```

